Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:03.69,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur3}柏林
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:08.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.57,0:00:10.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊 攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別畏懼 在這裡擋下它
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:00.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:03.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,壓倒性的力量吧 Destroy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:08.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確 一切成為焦土什麼都沒留下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:12.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打算這樣清掃到什麼地步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:16.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,任何還有ZAFT存在的地方 就要清除乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:21.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,給那些投緣的傢伙們一個教訓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.65,0:01:26.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們自然人和協調者是不同的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:32.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若有背叛行為就將落入地獄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.64,0:01:42.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.85,0:01:49.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:01:57.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘖 那些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:05.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這什麼大小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:12.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:21.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:22.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.26,0:02:24.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙是Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.63,0:02:25.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:34.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麼 我都…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:46.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:48.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:30.84,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4.5}史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:53.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 為什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:58.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,完全不把我放在眼裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:12.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,掩護他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:13.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gottfried瞄準
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:15.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:28.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈開了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:29.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:31.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去基拉他…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:34.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐  我們也出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:36.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑪基上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.99,0:05:39.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這場戰爭雖不是為了奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:42.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們無法坐視不理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 出動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:58.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,豈能置之不理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.11,0:06:16.36,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(936,668)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur3}ZAFT军事站
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.99,0:06:14.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 加迪納隊沒有回應
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:16.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對象目前正在柏林市內行進
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:19.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,直布羅陀採取了對應緊急事態的指示
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.28,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(944,665)}{\fad(500,0)}{\blur4.5}ZAFT最高评议会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:21.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,毫無任何警告就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,毫無保留地燒毀城市
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:29.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那些傢伙瘋了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:33.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都市駐留軍幾乎處於全滅狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:35.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 現在還是暫時撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:40.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但退了又如何
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:42.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撤退就能解決問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.68,0:06:46.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva呢  現在在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:51.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接受艦隊司令部的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在正駛向柏林
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.94,0:07:01.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但目前那艘船也戰力貧乏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:02.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去了也…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:04.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.97,0:07:07.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但不得不戰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:12.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒人阻止的話那傢伙會更變本加厲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不斷燒毀城市吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:19.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事絕不能容許
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,APU啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連接彈射器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Strike Attack使用空戰型裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Aile Striker準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:25.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Strike Rouge 出擊  請
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:32.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:34.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Strike Rouge  出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Murasame 池谷機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:47.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊  請
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:05.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:12.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是由MS的性能來決定強弱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你就由我來解決
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:15.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.44,0:08:24.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:27.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡交給我們
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:29.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:33.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,了解  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:38.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:39.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,豪  西澤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:40.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:46.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:50.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離目標還有40
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:52.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,取得光學影像
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前線司令部沒有回應
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由熱紋確認情況
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:01.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:03.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:09.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及Chaos  Windam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.10,0:09:12.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍Murasame  Strike Rouge
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:22.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會  為什麼那艘船會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:26.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是正義使者大天使
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:29.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,隨傳隨到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:32.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對MS戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:36.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:38.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:39.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:42.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到搭乘機內待機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:45.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到搭乘機內待機
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:47.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:48.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.85,0:09:51.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,形勢比想像的更混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:58.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經聯絡不到前線友軍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:10:02.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵軍現在正在和Freedom及Archangel戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:04.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會  為什麼他們…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:09.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不清楚他們的企圖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:11.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但別弄錯敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:16.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也知道戰力不足
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:19.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但本艦無論如何都必須阻止那東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:23.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,司令部對你抱有厚望
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:24.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:35.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:04.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:08.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這怪物太變態了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:11.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,城市中又不能使用Lohengrin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:13.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  休想得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:19.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那台Windam…為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉今後又得戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:45.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然可怕的東西會來殺死我們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:49.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉的話一定能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:52.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕的東西都必須除掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.17,0:12:07.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  核心戰機出發
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:18.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,熱源接近 4
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:21.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…Impulse
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:42.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,後方又出現Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.97,0:12:49.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然也想共同迎敵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:52.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今…很困難吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:09.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然可怕的東西會來殺死我們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:12.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以絕對要…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:16.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,送她回到平和溫暖的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:36.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:41.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.41,0:14:04.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就那麼想殺人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.46,0:14:19.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.79,0:14:23.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:24.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,坐在那上面的是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:26.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.81,0:14:44.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:53.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:03.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼  想當靶子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:06.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.77,0:15:08.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  哪裡中彈了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:13.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不然會殺死我們
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:17.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪琉艦長  這個拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:35.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:39.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
