Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,I wanna go to a place where I can say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,That I'm all right and I'm staying there with you
